# manhunters_desert (task CE; docs/reference/PLAYTEST.md 1). The ksim_manhunter_hunt setup as a file: the player alone in the wilderness
# outside every town, a Manhunter patrol of six nearby. Their dialogue package hunts outside towns (54937 "Man Hunter slave recapture
# shout", gated by DC_IN_A_NON_PLAYER_TOWN == 0): they should chase the player forever, put them down and take the capture chain through
# the world package's 167 row (strip, cuff, carry).
# Only the player is ever ordered (the scenario places the world; SCENARIO_IMPORT.md "Rule").
